To change the colours of the discount grid to match your theme, add the following CSS code at the bottom of your Theme CSS file:

```css
<style>
    #oscpPriceGrid th
    {
    color: white !important;
    background-color: #557b97 !important;
    }
</style>
```

This code sets the text color to white and the background color to a specific shade of blue. You can modify the colors to better match your theme's design [1].
